lexander-zanders-the-founder-revolutionising-africas-unbankable-farmers-into-a-100-billion-opportunity-with-just-a-credit-assessment/articleshow/132765566.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/meet-alexander-zanders-the-founder-revolutionising-africas-unbankable-farmers-into-a-100-billion-opportunity-with-just-a-credit-assessment/articleshow/132765566.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-31T16:52:06+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132765617,imgsize-60564.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[How beavers are restoring rivers, wetlands, and wildlife across North America]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132765647.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Once nearly eradicated due to extensive fur trapping, beavers are making a notable comeback in North American rivers. Their innate talent for constructing dams contributes to the formation of ponds and wetlands, which support a wide array of wildlife. The rejuvenated habitats formed by beavers enhance resilience against droughts and wildfires in arid areas.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/north-america-once-had-400-million-beavers-nearly-wiped-out-by-the-1900s-they-are-now-restoring-rivers-wetlands-and-wildlife-one-dam-at-a-time/articleshow/132765647.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/north-america-once-had-400-million-beavers-nearly-wiped-out-by-the-1900s-they-are-now-restoring-rivers-wetlands-and-wildlife-one-dam-at-a-time/articleshow/132765647.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-31T16:46:51+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132765773,imgsize-232882.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[How Iran's military ran a $4bn gambling network as part of a sanctions-dodging op: Report]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132764717.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/how-irans-military-ran-a-4bn-gambling-network-as-part-of-a-sanctions-dodging-op-report/articleshow/132764717.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/how-irans-military-ran-a-4bn-gambling-network-as-part-of-a-sanctions-dodging-op-report/articleshow/132764717.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-31T16:19:27+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Prisha Patnaik</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132764717,imgsize-1208696.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[In 1997, a mysterious sound echoed across the Pacific. Years later, scientists traced the 'Bloop' to Antarctica]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132764405.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/in-1997-a-mysterious-sound-echoed-across-the-pacific-years-later-scientists-traced-the-bloop-to-antarctica/articleshow/132764405.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/in-1997-a-mysterious-sound-echoed-across-the-pacific-years-later-scientists-traced-the-bloop-to-antarctica/articleshow/132764405.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-31T16:15:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132764746,imgsize-111530.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Punjab man Gurpreet Singh added to FBI’s ‘most want